WEBVTT

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:06.560
One plus one plus one would not equal three, but ten.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.030
We three believed that we could do it.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:12.860
We had to believe we could.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.450
The enemy is called "Vertex":

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.000
Abominations born from the virus.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.330
We have to repel them.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:29.090
However, to call those beings "Vertex"...

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.880
Why call them a word which means "pinnacle"?

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:25.390
That's enough!

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:33.610
The Heroes' powers can only be harnessed
by pure girls chosen by the Shinju-sama.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:36.150
You three will need to work hard.

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:39.620
That said, your next mission is...

00:01:41.740 --> 00:01:44.450
to take ample time to rest.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:45.460
Eh?

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:49.500
You can't transform if you don't have a sound mind.

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:53.460
In difficult times, you need to be able to hold out.

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:54.960
Hooray!

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.880
When it comes to taking a vacation,
I'm really good at that!

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.550
Me too! Me too!

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.140
Yay!

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.260
What should we do? What should we do?

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:02.850
Go to Ines?

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:15.650
In order to prepare for the next battle,
our current mission is to rest, huh?

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:20.160
That said, will I be able to relax?

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:25.580
Ojou-sama, Nogi-sama has come to visit you.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.410
This early in the morning?

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:30.040
Hey, Wasshi!

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:34.170
Let's enjoy KAGAWA LIFE!

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:37.010
Erm...

00:02:37.970 --> 00:02:40.640
That's a pretty classy car...
Your clothes are, too.

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:42.760
Ahh... Thank you!

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.890
Hey, want to go out so we can
enjoy this nice holiday?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.770
Th-That's fine with me...

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:50.400
Hooray!

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.900
Her holiday spirit worries me...

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:56.820
Hey, hey, hey!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:57.780
Oh, yes!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:01.450
Oh! Nice! Nice! Yeah!

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:02.490
Oh, everybody!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.990
Everybody say: yay, Kagawa!

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:06.620
Gin's pretty excited, too...

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:07.370
You too, Wasshi!

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.290
Let's get fired up!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:11.170
Hey, hey, yes!

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.540
I won't get fired up over a song...

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.170
Enjoy?

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:19.420
Banzai!

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:22.930
Yes, this is the start of a fun vacation!

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:23.760
Enjoy?

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:24.760
Banzai!

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.490
These clothes...

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:09.080
I don't think they really suit me, do they?

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:12.200
That's not true! Right, Wasshi?

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:17.460
Waaah, I've never seen someone nosebleed so much...

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:22.750
I-It totally fits you, Gin!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:26.880
B-But... what is this f-feeling swelling
up within my heart, I wonder?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.220
Right now, Wasshi seems like...

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:33.430
a total pro! It's amazing!

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.850
Ah! Pictures are love!

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:39.560
Ah, Gin! We'll try all sorts of
beautiful clothes on you today!

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:44.570
Amazing, Gin! Your name means "silver", but you're pure "gold"!

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.240
I don't get it!

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:48.820
You're hitting all my strike zones!

00:05:52.110 --> 00:05:53.570
Th-This has its own...

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.830
Definitely not!

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:56.750
Worth it!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.620
That went well.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:02.880
What did?!

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:05.010
We'll have Wasshi next, okay?

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:06.590
Eh?

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:10.800
I think this Western-style dress will suit you!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:13.100
I-I can't wear such unpatriotic clothes!

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.100
Nah, I think it suits you!

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:16.600
Eh?! No way!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.350
And, there! Put it on!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.270
There, there!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:24.530
You look great in that, Sumi!

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.110
You can even become an idol!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.110
I'll be fan number one!

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:29.990
N-No way...

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.530
There's no way I can wear...

00:06:33.950 --> 00:06:36.250
these unpatriotic clothes...

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.630
I am a failure as a Yamato Nadeshiko!

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:46.260
WaSuYu!

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.220
Sonoko's Dream

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.800
Sonocchi...

00:06:52.050 --> 00:06:53.090
I...

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:56.100
have decided to become an idol!

00:06:57.700 --> 00:06:59.310
Come and join me, too!

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.060
Me, too?

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.980
Rock!

00:07:02.270 --> 00:07:02.940
Let's go!

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:06.110
Our performance is about to start!

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:23.710
Get fired up like a Hero!

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.220
Rock!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.590
...and that's how the dream went.

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.220
Were there a lot of fans?

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.390
That's what you're curious about? That rocks!

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.100
Oooh...

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.100
WaSuYu!

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.190
Sumi, what are you drawing?

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:51.450
The second ship of the Shoukaku class:

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:52.950
Zuikaku!

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.200
It looks realistic!

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.160
Right?

00:07:55.490 --> 00:08:01.290
In the Old Era's Showa period, she participated in numerous
battles commissioned as our country's carrier!

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.500
Even as a decoy, she did her
best until the very end!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:08.170
S-Sumi knows a lot about stuff
like that, doesn't she?

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.010
That's because my dream is to become a historian!

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.090
She really is the serious type...

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.090
That dream really fits her, doesn't it?

00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.760
Sonocchi, do you have any dreams for the future?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:20.470
I think that becoming a novelist would be great!

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:23.600
I sometimes submit my works online.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.470
Ah, I can kinda see that!

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:28.320
She has a unique imagination, after all...

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:33.820
I want to write both of you as
characters in a novel one day!

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:38.990
The gentle but reliable Mino-san and the
serious but sometimes amusing Wasshi!

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.200
S-Sometimes... amusing?

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.120
Eh? Better than boring.

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:44.920
That's true, but...

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.670
I want to be relied on, too.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:52.630
I think it's cute when you get
all shy like that, Sumi.

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:55.420
Eh? That doesn't sound like
a compliment at all...

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:59.840
Wow! That's good! The chemistry
between you two is great!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.020
It's really good!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.140
Really great!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.650
Wh-What about your dreams, Gin?

00:09:07.650 --> 00:09:12.860
When I was in kindergarten, I wanted to be someone who
protected my family and everyone: a Pretty Guardian!

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:13.650
I can relate!

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:17.280
Protecting the country as an ally of justice!
That's every girl's aspiration!

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:18.530
And now?

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.040
Hmm... Ehehe...

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.870
Hey, why are you blushing?

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:30.120
Well, having a family is a good thing,
so I was thinking of having one...

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:34.550
But if that's the case, then my
future dream would be...

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:38.550
t-to be a b-bride.

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:43.100
Mino-san, you'll fulfill that dream in no time!

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.980
I can't wait to see you in a white kimono!

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:47.350
What's with you?! Stop poking me!

00:09:47.350 --> 00:09:49.610
I'll use that as content for my novel!

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.730
Stop that! It's embarrassing!

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.320
Do you want to practice the goodbye kiss part?

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.940
A novel, huh?

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:58.820
Do you want to practice the goodbye kiss part?

00:09:58.820 --> 00:09:59.200
No way!

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:05.620
This is it!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.040
Sonocchi's novel...

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.540
Th-The reviews are amazing!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.340
She even has the most readers!

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:17.210
She's really amazing, that Sonocchi...

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.470
Ah! I know!

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:26.350
I'll submit a historical novel and set
everyone's patriotism aflame!

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:32.690
Now, let's see those reviews...

00:10:37.490 --> 00:10:39.900
I've failed in sharing the glory of my country!

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.780
I hate my lacking self!

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:42.950
WaSuYu!

00:10:43.570 --> 00:10:45.910
Sonoko's Dream: Deux

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:49.210
Hey, Wasshi!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.290
Look over here!

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.960
No, I am not Wasshi.

00:10:55.580 --> 00:10:57.170
My real identity is...

00:10:58.300 --> 00:10:59.630
Enrich the country; strengthen the military!

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:01.220
The ally of justice!

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.930
Everyone, stand at attention!

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:06.890
I am Kokubou Kamen!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.390
Rock!

00:11:10.390 --> 00:11:12.310
So cool!

00:11:12.310 --> 00:11:14.570
...and that's how the dream went.

00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:18.790
Wasshi looked like this and was an ally of justice!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.740
Oh my! What a stylish costume!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:21.990
Rock!

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:22.990
WaSuYu!

00:11:23.570 --> 00:11:26.740
Orientation for the new first year
students is coming up soon.

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:32.120
Be aware that you all are sixth years,
and take good care of your juniors.

00:11:33.620 --> 00:11:36.920
What do we do for the orientation again?

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:40.670
We go along and have fun with the first years.

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:42.970
We'll be accompanying pure white first years...

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:47.930
Our duty as Heroes is to protect this country!

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.140
In other words!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:50.310
In other words?

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:57.270
In order to provide for our future, raising the children into ardent patriots is part of our sacred duty!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:11:58.570
Is it, really?

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.990
That sounds kinda fun.

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.450
Let's plan for that, then!

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.530
What's this here?

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:08.820
I found a letter in my desk.

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:10.120
A letter of challenge?!

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.540
Be careful! That might be a cursed chain letter!

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:13.920
Let's see...

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:17.670
"I've come to realize that I've
always had my eyes on you."

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:19.960
I knew it was a challenge!
Where will the duel take place?

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:22.420
It's a curse! We might need
to bring purification salt!

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:25.970
"I want to become friends with you."

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:29.550
That's more terrifying than getting cursed.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:36.100
"I know that your duty is hard,
but that is why I want to be your support."

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:37.100
So it says.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:40.110
C-C-Could this be...

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:42.360
Could it be... "that", Sumi?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.190
The thing that begins with "lo"—

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:45.190
A Lohan statue?

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:46.900
No! A love letter!

00:12:47.150 --> 00:12:48.280
Oh, I see...

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:56.290
Ah, so I got a love letter.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:57.790
This makes me happy.

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:06.010
Looking at the handwriting and
the envelope, I can already tell:

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.930
the sender is a girl.

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.680
Oh, a girl, huh.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.560
I have returned.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:18.100
Welcome back.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:20.190
Sumi-sama, for you.

00:13:21.060 --> 00:13:21.770
Japan, xxx Prefecture, Oohashi city, Oohashi town
Washio Sumi-sama

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:22.900
Is this...

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:23.550
Japan, xxx Prefecture, Oohashi city, Oohashi town
Washio Sumi-sama

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:30.200
Did I get a love letter, too?

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:38.200
From, Anonymous
Please be careful.
but you come off as nitpicky when you give others warnings.
Washio-san. You may be an honors student,

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:40.500
Homage to the all-pervading Vajras!

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:43.460
O Violent One of great wrath, destroy!

00:13:44.170 --> 00:13:46.510
For me to get excited over a single scrap of paper...

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:48.630
What an inexcusable blunder!

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:54.020
WaSuYu!

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:56.840
Here we go, Sonoko!

00:13:57.980 --> 00:13:59.310
I'm going to push!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:00.550
Let's dive to the Sea God's Palace!

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:00.560
So fast!
Let's dive to the Sea God's Palace!

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.770
So fast!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:04.740
Two, two, three, four!

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:05.110
One, two, three, four!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:09.240
Hey, Sumi! How long are you going to do warm-ups?

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:15.660
Water accidents are scary. You need to do your warm-ups or it will be bad for your heart!

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:19.280
The place is reserved for us, so let's play to our heart's content!

00:14:19.860 --> 00:14:20.790
Hey, hey.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:25.290
If the enemy were to attack now,
would we sortie in our swimsuits?

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:27.830
I wouldn't like that to happen...

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:30.970
The chances of that happening are low in the first place...

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:35.600
You saw how fast the first one arrived,
so you shouldn't let your guard down.

00:14:36.090 --> 00:14:39.980
You're really bouncy, Sumi.
Are you sure you aren't a high schooler?

00:14:39.980 --> 00:14:43.610
She might be one level above!
Probably a university student!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.320
Yeah, yeah...

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:48.570
Hey, Gin. Wanna race?

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:51.190
Interesting. I accept your challenge!

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:54.770
We have orientation after this, so make sure you don't go all ou—

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:56.230
And, go!

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.790
Ahahaha...

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.750
They didn't listen, did they?

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:10.010
That's what you get for going all out in the pool...

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.220
No biggie! I can keep going!

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.420
I can't wait for the presentation day...

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:16.750
Thank you.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:22.480
It's thanks to you two that we can
make this a wonderful orientation.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:38.950
Now, from the other side of the sea comes an evil
monster who wants to attack our country!

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:40.330
How dreadful! How dreadful!

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:44.040
Stomp! Stomp!

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:46.170
What a beautiful place!

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:48.920
Give me this land!

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.680
So says the evil monster!

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:53.180
What would you do?!

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:56.170
Eh... uhm... I'll run.

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:59.590
If you do that, the monster
will take your house.

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:01.640
Oh... what do I do?

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:02.560
I'll fight!

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:05.800
That's right! The Shinju-sama is with us!

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:09.230
Stand your ground and fight!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.740
Together with Kokubou Kamen!

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:14.200
Eh? There's nothing there.

00:16:14.200 --> 00:16:16.950
Oh? You're right!

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:19.700
Then, let's try calling them!

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:21.440
Repeat after Onee-san!

00:16:21.440 --> 00:16:21.460
One, two!
Repeat after Onee-san!

00:16:21.460 --> 00:16:22.610
One, two!

00:16:22.610 --> 00:16:22.620
Kokubou Kamen!
One, two!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:27.460
Kokubou Kamen!

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:31.040
The people call us to defend the country!

00:16:31.040 --> 00:16:33.550
They shout for us to defend love!

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.540
Everyone stand at attention!
Everyone stand at attention!

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.430
Warriors of Patriotism:
Warriors of Patriotism:

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.810
Kokubou Kamen has arrived!
Kokubou Kamen has arrived!

00:16:44.300 --> 00:16:50.360
Now! Let's learn proper national defense
while doing fun calisthenics!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:52.070
Now, everyone, stand!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:55.230
Today's forecast is fine weather.

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.730
We shall now begin national defense.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:02.160
Be careful not to bump
into your friends, okay?

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.080
Here we go!

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:04.390
Enrich the country; strengthen the military!

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:05.760
You overdid it!

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:07.050
We're sorry.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.270
WaSuYu!

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:11.430
Sonoko's Dream: Troix

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:16.810
You three!

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:19.940
As punishment for brainwashing your underclassmen,

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:23.290
I forbid you to eat udon for a week!

00:18:23.290 --> 00:18:25.080
It can't be! Rock!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.160
This is a joke, right?

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:35.870
I can't eat udon anymore!

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:37.500
That's bad! We have to take you to a hospital right now!

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:38.260
I'm done for!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.640
Calm down, you two.

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.010
WaSuYu!

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:43.790
I brought you some tea.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:43.810
Thank you.
I brought you some tea.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:44.800
Thank you.

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:49.090
But Sumi, you need to leave some
of the jobs for the maids.

00:18:50.020 --> 00:18:52.480
It calms me down when I'm doing something.

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:56.650
It's a Sunday, so why don't you hang
out with Nogi-san and Minowa-san?

00:18:56.650 --> 00:19:00.320
Since Gin is busy, I'm free for now.

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:03.620
Then you should be free to do what you want.

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:09.900
I was hoping that Gin would message
me to hang out after she's done.

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:14.030
And Sonocchi might come here
out of the blue like last time.

00:19:16.550 --> 00:19:18.920
You've made some wonderful friends.

00:19:32.640 --> 00:19:34.360
She's already lost?!

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.900
We ended up gathering together after all, huh?

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:44.120
We were drawn together naturally
because we're all Heroes!

00:19:44.120 --> 00:19:47.330
Geez, it's a good thing Gin picked you up.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:51.210
Should we not introduce ourselves to your family?

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.170
It's fine.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:55.210
Dad and Mom probably know you already.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:57.590
Besides, I'm not good with that kind of stuff.

00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:02.670
Going shopping with all your family
on your day off is so wonderful.

00:20:03.180 --> 00:20:05.970
Still, it's a bit embarrassing when I
end up meeting someone I know.

00:20:07.920 --> 00:20:11.180
Anyway, I'm done with my errands,
so I can go with you guys now.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:14.310
Although, wait just a bit.

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:21.190
Come on, waga otouto,

00:20:21.190 --> 00:20:24.060
Onee-chan's holding you, so don't cry.

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:24.070
There, there.
Onee-chan's holding you, so don't cry.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:25.520
There, there.

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.480
There we go, smile.

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:41.210
It's too bad our time off is
going to be over soon.

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:45.010
Back to being ever-vigilant, huh.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.970
We need to be ready for that.

00:20:50.750 --> 00:20:54.690
Even though the orientation went like that, it was really fun.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:55.940
Yeah.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.690
It went by so quickly!

00:21:02.180 --> 00:21:04.640
Oh right, my home's in a different direction.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:10.660
See you guys.

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:27.630
Sumi?

00:21:28.790 --> 00:21:30.130
Wasshi?

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.590
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:39.010
No, I understand you.

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:41.270
"Our vacation's going to end."

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.280
That's what you're thinking, right?

00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:47.700
Even though I said I was confident about resting,

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:53.200
I was unsure if I could really relax
with this kind of duty on me.

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.000
But?

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:58.700
With the three of us, there was no need to worry.

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:00.840
I think so, too!

00:22:01.460 --> 00:22:03.580
I had so much fun!

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:05.790
You too, right, Wasshi?

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:08.680
Yep, that's a face that says "yes".

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:16.670
If the Vertex destroy the Shinju-sama,
this fun daily life will disappear, won't it?

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:19.890
I'm definitely not going to let them!

00:22:19.890 --> 00:22:19.900
Right?
I'm definitely not going to let them!

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:20.440
Right?

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:21.310
Yep!

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:24.720
Of course, I share the same thought.

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:26.280
Let's do our best!

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:27.320
Yeah!

00:22:29.320 --> 00:22:31.690
Well, we can't go home like this.

00:22:31.690 --> 00:22:32.660
Disbanded! Disbanded!

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:33.860
I've got an idea!

00:22:33.860 --> 00:22:35.860
Let's have a sleepover right away!

00:22:35.860 --> 00:22:36.860
Sounds great!

00:22:36.860 --> 00:22:37.860
At Gin's place.

00:22:37.860 --> 00:22:41.040
My place?! My brothers are there, you know?!

00:24:13.930 --> 00:24:15.850
Heroes do it with fighting spirit and guts!

00:24:15.850 --> 00:24:16.950
What?! There's two of them?!

00:24:16.950 --> 00:24:17.720
What the hell is this?

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:18.600
That thing used its arrows...

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:19.600
Today was fun!

00:24:19.600 --> 00:24:20.250
As expected of Sonocchi...

00:24:20.250 --> 00:24:20.770
Get the hell...

00:24:20.770 --> 00:24:20.930
As expected of Sonocchi...

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:24.650
Get the hell...
